<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amgen price target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amgen price target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it raised the one-year price target on Amgen Inc to $75 from $66.</p>
<p>-- said Amgen hosted an &quot;upbeat&quot; analysts meeting in New York Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- cited Amgen's confidence in the continued strong performance of Epogen and Neupogen.</p>
<p>-- said Amgen told analysts it expects to bring five new products to market over the next five years and highlighted its research and development pipeline.</p>
<p>-- Amgen gained 1/8 to 61-3/4.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
